Method : Dyanmic Programming
Time Complexity: O(n x A)
Space Complexity : O(A)

Conclusion –
Coin Change using DP
The Coin Change problem was solved using Dynamic Programming. 
The minimum number of coins required to make the given amount is found by breaking the problem into smaller subproblems and storing their results. 
This avoids repeated calculations and gives an efficient solution.
